# Job

Add tests. Do not add features, plan tiers, captions, or texting.

## Dealer pull

Save fixture HTML for a full inventory page, a second pull where one car is gone and one car is new, and a short partial page. Assert miles, price, and VIN still parse. A second full pull marks the missing car sold and the new car arrived. A partial page must not mark the rest of the lot sold.

## Facebook fill

Save a fixture of the Marketplace vehicle form. The fill must select vehicle type, year, and exterior color, and type the VIN. Map dealer color names onto Facebook’s list. A color that is not on the list becomes Other, then the menu closes. The fill never presses Publish.

## Payments

Cover these cases:

- Basic monthly checkout sets a 7-day trial, collects a card, and cancels the trial if the card is missing. Due today is $0.
- Premium and Premium Plus checkout do not set a trial.
- `checkout.session.completed` with `no_payment_required` turns Basic on during the trial.
- `past_due`, `unpaid`, and `customer.subscription.deleted` close the desk.
- `invoice.paid` leaves the desk open.
- A new account with no checkout does not get a plan.

Run the tests and fix only what they catch.
